{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the plague. Embrace the chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo delivers a tight vertical slice of <i>Plagun</i>\u2019s fast-paced roguelike action\u2014survive the first three levels, experiment with cursed masks and power-ups, and uncover a mysterious figure who hints at the plague\u2019s darker secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/dabdbbda95164ff7d38e4ceff1108095.avif?t=1758036892\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plagun</strong> is a grotesque roguelike shooter set in a post-apocalyptic kingdom rotting from a failed cure for death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/565414007238acc47a8213ab47163839.poster.avif?t=1758036892\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/565414007238acc47a8213ab47163839.webm?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/565414007238acc47a8213ab47163839.mp4?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a masked survivor\u2014once a doctor, now a monster\u2014using plague-infused weapons and cursed masks to fight back against an endless tide of regenerating horrors. Every corpse you collect strengthens your run. Every mask changes how you play. Every weapon is a twisted tool of infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs are short, intense, and always evolving. Choose your gear, survive escalating waves, and uncover the dark truth behind the plague that ruined the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/2fd8790ae8929aae50fa0a55f44086d1.avif?t=1758036892\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-Hell Mayhem</strong><br><br>Auto-shooting action meets tight platforming and fast, wave-based encounters.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skull Mask Builds</strong><br><br>Equip unlockable masks that alter your stats and grant passive powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biomechanical Weapons</strong><br><br>Wield grotesque Plaguns\u2014revolvers, melee hybrids, and experimental tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/5eb6862a1f9ff4f88008676de8b18c40.poster.avif?t=1758036892\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/5eb6862a1f9ff4f88008676de8b18c40.webm?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/5eb6862a1f9ff4f88008676de8b18c40.mp4?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Power-Ups</strong><br><br>Adapt to mutating runs with unpredictable upgrades and perks.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong><br><br>Gather corpses to unlock new gear and meta-abilities between runs.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Lore &amp; Atmosphere</strong><br> Discover a fallen kingdom through environmental storytelling and cryptic logs.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick-Up-And-Die Gameplay</strong><br> Each session lasts 15\u201320 minutes. Easy to jump in. Hard to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/fb985a96a33275cd4724c770767818ca.poster.avif?t=1758036892\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/fb985a96a33275cd4724c770767818ca.webm?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/fb985a96a33275cd4724c770767818ca.mp4?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the plague. Wear the mask. Survive.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931400?t=1758036892","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/89a5bcda90d54e9ab37a073552fcb68f6eca74c2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758036892","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/18d2f5244a7f4f786125e9ff34124d5855168654/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758036892","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/18d2f5244a7f4f786125e9ff34124d5855168654/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758036892","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>PLAY THE DEMO!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/07d7b70d000904db0d93e6c8d3f230c5.poster.avif?t=1758036892\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/07d7b70d000904db0d93e6c8d3f230c5.webm?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/07d7b70d000904db0d93e6c8d3f230c5.mp4?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the plague. Embrace the chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo delivers a tight vertical slice of <i>Plagun</i>\u2019s fast-paced roguelike action\u2014survive the first three levels, experiment with cursed masks and power-ups, and uncover a mysterious figure who hints at the plague\u2019s darker secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/dabdbbda95164ff7d38e4ceff1108095.avif?t=1758036892\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plagun</strong> is a grotesque roguelike shooter set in a post-apocalyptic kingdom rotting from a failed cure for death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/565414007238acc47a8213ab47163839.poster.avif?t=1758036892\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/565414007238acc47a8213ab47163839.webm?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/565414007238acc47a8213ab47163839.mp4?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a masked survivor\u2014once a doctor, now a monster\u2014using plague-infused weapons and cursed masks to fight back against an endless tide of regenerating horrors. Every corpse you collect strengthens your run. Every mask changes how you play. Every weapon is a twisted tool of infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs are short, intense, and always evolving. Choose your gear, survive escalating waves, and uncover the dark truth behind the plague that ruined the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/2fd8790ae8929aae50fa0a55f44086d1.avif?t=1758036892\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-Hell Mayhem</strong><br><br>Auto-shooting action meets tight platforming and fast, wave-based encounters.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skull Mask Builds</strong><br><br>Equip unlockable masks that alter your stats and grant passive powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biomechanical Weapons</strong><br><br>Wield grotesque Plaguns\u2014revolvers, melee hybrids, and experimental tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/5eb6862a1f9ff4f88008676de8b18c40.poster.avif?t=1758036892\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/5eb6862a1f9ff4f88008676de8b18c40.webm?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/5eb6862a1f9ff4f88008676de8b18c40.mp4?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Power-Ups</strong><br><br>Adapt to mutating runs with unpredictable upgrades and perks.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong><br><br>Gather corpses to unlock new gear and meta-abilities between runs.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Lore &amp; Atmosphere</strong><br> Discover a fallen kingdom through environmental storytelling and cryptic logs.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick-Up-And-Die Gameplay</strong><br> Each session lasts 15\u201320 minutes. Easy to jump in. Hard to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/fb985a96a33275cd4724c770767818ca.poster.avif?t=1758036892\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/fb985a96a33275cd4724c770767818ca.webm?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/extras/fb985a96a33275cd4724c770767818ca.mp4?t=1758036892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the plague. Wear the mask. Survive.</strong></h2>","developers":["Talkinguns"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3805100","name":"PLAGUN \u2013 The Plague Goes On"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931400/522d4c419ac387f928b6a3ba22849203902db039/header.jpg?t=1758036892","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u